{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17772","headline":"赠邻家老将 · 杨巨源","name":"赠邻家老将","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白首羽林郎，丁年戍朔方。\n阴天瞻碛落，秋日渡辽阳。\n大漠寒山黑，孤城夜月黄。\n十年依蓐食，万里带金疮。\n拂雪陈师祭，冲风立敎场。\n箭飞琼羽合，旗动火云张。\n虎翼分营势，鱼鳞拥阵行。\n誓心清塞色，鬬血杂沙光。\n战地晴辉薄，军门晓气长。\n寇深争暗袭，关逈勒春防。\n身贱竟何诉，天高徒自伤。\n功成封宠将，力尽到贫乡。\n雀老方悲海，鹰衰却念霜。\n空余孤劒在，开匣一沾裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}